GTSAM optimizes factor graphs for sensor fusion and state estimation.
This shared C++17 CPU profile uses common Eigen with GCC16. It preserves
upstream matrix rotations and tangent IMU preintegration. Boost extensions,
serialization, TBB, GPU acceleration, unstable modules and language wrappers
are outside this profile. Synthetic graph contracts validate bounded behavior;
they do not establish real sensor or physical-robot navigation performance.
